WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:02.235
-We have a great show tonight.

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:04.971
You know, the holiday spirit
is really all around us,

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.640
and especially here in New York.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.443
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Hey, Jimmy?

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:11.610
Sorry, do you have a second?

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.046
-Oh, yeah.
Hey, Lea Michele.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:14.247
Yeah, what's up?

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:16.583
-I'm just trying to get
the Wi-Fi password.

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:19.252
[ Light laughter ]
-You want the Wi-Fi password?

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:20.953
-Yeah, you know, Wi-Fi password.

00:00:20.953 --> 00:00:23.256
It's like the Internet
that comes through the air?

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:26.159
Wi-Fi.
-No, I know what Wi-Fi is.

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:28.127
I'm just a little bit busy
right now.

00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:30.897
I'm just in the middle
of doing the show.

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:32.999
-Oh, my gosh.

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:34.500
I -- I had no idea.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.467
I had no idea.

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:38.004
This is --
This is so embarrassing.

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:39.038
This is so embarrassing.
-It's Okay, Lea.

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:41.408
Its no big deal.
-No! It's a big deal.

00:00:41.408 --> 00:00:44.978
I've ruined the entire show.
-You haven't ruined the show.

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:46.946
I mean, just go back
to your dressing room.

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:48.681
We'll get you the Wi-Fi.

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:50.850
-Okay.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.186
♪♪

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:55.254
♪ Oh, what have I done? ♪

00:00:55.254 --> 00:00:57.022
♪ What was I thinking? ♪

00:00:57.022 --> 00:00:59.792
♪ I wanted Wi-Fi,
so I went out on stage ♪

00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:01.861
♪ I'm such a fool ♪

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:04.697
♪ I'm out of the business ♪

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:06.866
♪ Yes, it's time to part ways ♪

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:09.535
♪ I'm out of the business ♪

00:01:09.535 --> 00:01:12.438
♪ Guess I'll have to do plays ♪

00:01:12.438 --> 00:01:14.840
♪ I'm out of the business ♪

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:17.743
-No, stop, stop, stop!
Whoa, Lea, Lea. Stop. Stop.

00:01:17.743 --> 00:01:19.712
You're not out of the business.

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:21.280
You just --
Just go backstage, relax.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.449
I'll get the show back on track,
and we'll let you know

00:01:23.449 --> 00:01:25.284
when it's time for you
and Jonathan Groff.

00:01:25.284 --> 00:01:26.486
-Okay.
-Yeah.

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:28.321
-Hey, Jimmy.
[ cheers and applause ]

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:30.022
-No, no, no, no.

00:01:30.022 --> 00:01:31.557
No, no, no, no.

00:01:31.557 --> 00:01:33.359
It's Jonathan Groff.
No, Jonathan.

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:34.727
I was just saying your name.

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:36.395
It doesn't mean that you're
supposed to come out here.

00:01:36.395 --> 00:01:37.464
-Oh.

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:39.231
I didn't actually
hear you say my name.

00:01:39.231 --> 00:01:42.235
I was just wondering if you knew
where the bathroom is.

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:43.069
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.069 --> 00:01:45.604
Is it that bucket backstage?

00:01:45.604 --> 00:01:47.840
-What? No!

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:51.143
-Of course not, yes.

00:01:51.143 --> 00:01:55.181
Unrelated, just don't look
in that bucket, please.

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.548
So what's going on out here?

00:01:56.548 --> 00:01:58.384
-I'm in the middle of the show.

00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:00.019
-Oh, my God.

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:02.354
You're in the middle
of a taping?

00:02:02.354 --> 00:02:04.357
-Yeah.
-I believe this.

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:07.026
I have just completely
ruined your show.

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:09.194
-No, you haven't ruined
the show. It's fine.

00:02:09.194 --> 00:02:11.630
Just go backstage,
and I'll call you out later.

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:13.966
-[ Sighs ]

00:02:13.966 --> 00:02:19.572
♪♪

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:21.740
♪ What have I done? ♪

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:23.943
♪ What was I thinking? ♪

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:27.112
♪ Nature called, so I answered ♪

00:02:27.112 --> 00:02:30.450
♪ And now nobody will
answer my calls ♪

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:35.120
♪ I'm out of the business ♪

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:38.024
♪ No more champagne or cigars ♪

00:02:38.024 --> 00:02:40.926
♪ I'm out of the business ♪

00:02:40.926 --> 00:02:46.231
♪ Guess I'll do on
"Dancing With the Stars" ♪

00:02:46.231 --> 00:02:48.634
♪ I'm out of the business ♪
-No, no, no.

00:02:48.634 --> 00:02:51.003
Please, please, please.
Stop! Jonathan, stop.

00:02:51.003 --> 00:02:52.471
Everyone stop.

00:02:52.471 --> 00:02:54.306
Neither of you are
out of the business.

00:02:54.306 --> 00:02:55.641
It's all fine.

00:02:55.641 --> 00:02:57.143
Can you please just go and wait

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:58.544
until it's your time
to come out.

00:02:58.544 --> 00:03:00.412
-Sure. sure, sure.
Sure, Jimmy.

00:03:00.412 --> 00:03:01.581
-Sorry, sir.
-Yeah.

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:04.083
Sorry.

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:10.656
♪♪

00:03:10.656 --> 00:03:13.592
-♪ What have I done? ♪

00:03:13.592 --> 00:03:16.529
♪ What was I thinking? ♪

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:18.097
♪ I was rude to my guests ♪

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:21.100
♪ That's not how a host
should behave ♪

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:24.570
♪ I'm out of the business ♪

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:26.339
♪ What have I done? ♪

00:03:26.339 --> 00:03:29.675
♪ I'm out of the business ♪

00:03:29.675 --> 00:03:31.944
-Jimmy, wait!

00:03:31.944 --> 00:03:34.913
-Oh, my gosh.

00:03:34.913 --> 00:03:39.384
It's 8-year-old me from --
sent from the past.

00:03:39.384 --> 00:03:41.053
Did you come to remind me

00:03:41.053 --> 00:03:43.289
why I got into the business
in the first place?

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:45.791
-And that you should always
fight to fulfill your dreams.

00:03:45.791 --> 00:03:48.061
-And that second chances
are always possible,

00:03:48.061 --> 00:03:49.862
no matter what you may
or may not have done

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:51.364
inside of a bucket?

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:52.431
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.431 --> 00:03:53.933
-No.

00:03:53.933 --> 00:03:56.568
I'm the president
of the network's kid.

00:03:56.568 --> 00:03:58.804
My dad's busy green-lighting
"Minions 8,"

00:03:58.804 --> 00:04:00.539
but he wanted me to tell you...

00:04:00.539 --> 00:04:04.143
♪ You're out of the business ♪

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:08.114
♪ Time to leave Hollywood ♪

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:10.883
♪ I get to host now ♪

00:04:10.883 --> 00:04:14.120
♪ My dad said I could ♪

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:17.223
-♪ He is our host now ♪

00:04:17.223 --> 00:04:21.094
♪ His dad said he could ♪

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:23.896
-♪ Bring me some water ♪

00:04:23.896 --> 00:04:27.333
♪ And some candy and snacks ♪

00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:30.736
♪ And don't change the channel ♪

00:04:30.736 --> 00:04:36.909
-♪ Because we will
be right back ♪

00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:38.411
[ Cheers and applause]

